      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Introduces the National eHealth Strategy Toolkit, explaining its purpose and intended users. It notes how eHealth makes health systems more efficient and responsive, and that the toolkit provides a framework and method for developing a national eHealth vision, action plan and monitoring framework in three successive parts.",
